================================================================================
Third-party code included in this repository
================================================================================

Most third-party software is a declared dependency, installed at build time and
listed with its version in:

  backend/requirements.txt, backend/requirements-dev.txt   (Python, pinned with hashes)
  frontend/package-lock.json                               (JavaScript)

The licences of those dependencies are their own; nothing of them is copied into
this repository. An SBOM of a built image is produced by scripts/sbom.sh.

No third-party code is vendored in this repository: nothing is copied in, so
every licence above belongs to a dependency that is fetched at build time.

The applications for other tools, which are not published yet, do carry one
vendored copy (a Splunk SDK, Apache License 2.0). This file gains its entry with
their release.
